WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.508
Two-to-one games, perfect completeness.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.801
Each answer has exactly two partners. Hardness was

3
00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:08.164
stuck at twenty three over twenty four.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.190
Formulas become a repeated game, stacked so

5
